{"n": 385, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "385.webp", "text": "730 24 05/\n\nCars with DME;\n\nUnscrew bolts,\n\nPull out speed sender (1) and reterence\nmark sender (2).\n\nImportant! ~ installation\n\nCheck Installed position and don't mix\nup plugs.\n\nInstall speed sender (1) In bore (D) and\nreference mark sender (2) with ring (3)\nIn bore (B).\n\nEngine cannot be started when mixed\nup.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCheck O-rings.\n\nInstall senders with Molykote Longterm\n2.\n\nImportant!\n\nKeep grease and dirt off of face of\nDOME senders.\n\nCars with EH Transmission:\n\nTurn bayonet fastener (1) to the left.\nPull off plug (2).\n\nLift wire harness out of holders.\nInstallation:\n\nConnect plug (2) In such a manner that\nthe marks are aligned.\n\nVersion with Kickdown Preventer:\nPull off plug.\n\nSupport transmission with Special\nTools 24 0 120 and 00 2 020.\nRemove cross member.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCenter transmission - see Group 26.\nTightening torque’.\n\n* See Specifications\n\nUnscrew Joint disc on transmission\nDisconnect shift linkage (5)\nInstallation\n\nAdjust selector lever - see 24 00 006\n\ninstallation.\n\nReplace stop nuts.\n\nTighten nuts with a standard 17 mm\nwrench socket and a torque wrench\nTightening torque’.\n\nImportant!\n\nOnly tighten the nuts (never bolts) to\navoid tension In the joint disc.\n\nVersion with Cable:\n\nLoosen nut (2) (counterhold).\nDetach cable on counterholder.\nPull out cable.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTightening torque\".\n\nAdjust shift - see 24 00 006.\n\nLoosen screwed-on ring (1) several\nturns.\n\ninstallation.\n\nTighten screwed-on ring (1) with\nSpecial Tool 26 1 040 after finishing\nInstallation.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["730", 0.1864, 0.2798, 0.2011, 0.2878], ["24", 0.2062, 0.2792, 0.2153, 0.2871], ["05/", 0.2199, 0.2785, 0.2351, 0.2865], ["Cars", 0.273, 0.0696, 0.2979, 0.0809], ["with", 0.3019, 0.0703, 0.3237, 0.0809], ["DME;", 0.3278, 0.0703, 0.3556, 0.0809], ["Unscrew", 0.2725, 0.